# Text outside a format's braces is any text (asked by X_eTaL-games):
# SVG markup, an open quote, a `#` color; only the braces hold X_eTaL.
== SOURCE
p_rint! @ f_ormat< "<rect \"{1 + 2}\""
p_rint! @ f_ormat< "class=\"light\" fill=\"{1}\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"4\""
== RESULT
<rect "3"
<rect "3"
class="light" fill="1" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="4"
class="light" fill="1" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="4"
